208
00:19:26,982 --> 00:19:31,146
I could get the paperwork together and see you back here in three weeks .

209
00:19:37,459 --> 00:19:39,154
All right .

210
00:19:49,071 --> 00:19:50,129
Okey-dokey .

211
00:19:50,305 --> 00:19:52,330
